y are skeptical of low-evidence-value experiments with confounded interpretations, preferring controlled baselines, non-IID generalization tests, and diagnostics that cleanly distinguish hypotheses. They value conceptual generality (architecture-agnostic interpretability, universal learning dynamics) and calm, accessible public communication.", "past_choices": []}
